# Control Plane Rules

- Type hints on all function parameters and return types.
- Validate requests/responses with Pydantic models.
- Lint/format with Ruff.
- Webhook HMAC is mandatory; missing signature or secret = reject.
- Repositories must be pre-registered; webhook must not auto-create repos with defaults.
- On policy pass: update Git manifest carefully (`image_name:tag`); status `passed` until ArgoCD confirms deploy.
- OPA unreachable => deny unless `OPA_ALLOW_LOCAL_FALLBACK=true`.
- Do not use `datetime.utcnow()`; use `datetime.now(timezone.utc)`.
